 "remarks": "Beautifully updated 4-bedroom Colonial in convenient North Wilton, blending classic charm with thoughtful modern improvements. Set on a picturesque property with wonderful curb appeal, this move-in ready home features a renovated interior filled with natural light. The beautifully updated kitchen is the true heart of the home, designed for cooking and gathering with generous workspace. The first-floor plan flows beautifully from room to room, ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The spacious family room features a stone fireplace, while the dining room has French doors opening to a Trex deck and fenced backyard. A first-floor home office offers adaptable space for work or a possible guest room. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite and three additional well-sized bedrooms offer generous closet space. The finished lower level provides flexible space for a family room, playroom, or fitness area. Extensive improvements include renovated baths, refinished hardwood floors, new roof, updated electrical, propane conversion, well and water system updates, finished garage, and more. Major mechanicals and systems are four years old or newer. Convenient to Wilton schools, Wilton Town Center, Georgetown, Route 7, and Ridgefield.",
